      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DREAM BIG (1) has been out of the placings at his last two outings but shapes well for this if he can recapture his excellent win a few runs back, getting around this track over 400m in 22.35. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. MAC AND CHEESE (3) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 5 lengths (22.65) at Warrnambool. Comes through a solid form race last start. Has ability and can measure up. ASTON MALI (5) jumped well and was in the mix early before fading out of it late when 7th over 400m at Warragul in Grade 5 company. Has a strong winning record here at this journey. Can measure up this time. DRAGON BLACK (2) is a course and distance winner worth keeping in mind.",
